flowchart TD
    START[Request ticket details] --> SESSION{Signed in?}
    SESSION -->|No| LOGIN[Sign in]
    SESSION -->|Yes| ROLE{Agent or admin?}
    ROLE -->|Yes| ALL[Load ticket and public + internal comments]
    ROLE -->|No| OWNER{Ticket belongs to requester?}
    OWNER -->|No| DENY[Return not found / forbidden]
    OWNER -->|Yes| PUBLIC[Load ticket and public comments only]
    ALL --> RESPONSE[Render conversation]
    PUBLIC --> RESPONSE
